Description: Provides fast, in-memory reading of 'DATASUS' 'DBC' files, along
    with a catalog of public health data sources, 'FTP' file discovery,
    caching downloads, and a high-level datasus_fetch() function that lists,
    downloads, and reads files in a single call. The reader is the 'Rust'
    crate 'datasus-core', bundled with the package: it decodes 'PKWare DCL'
    compressed 'DBC' files with a port of the 'blast' decompressor from
    'zlib' contrib/blast and parses 'DBF' records directly for efficient
    import into tibbles. See the 'DATASUS' file transfer site
    <https://datasus.saude.gov.br> and Adler (2003)
    <https://github.com/madler/zlib/tree/master/contrib/blast> for details on
    the underlying data and compression format.
